  - Projects with the same name — duplicate rule · sync · enabled · matching table: contoso_project · status: Published · touches: contoso_name
- **Post-operation (sync)** _(Same rank — order between plugins and real-time workflows is not guaranteed)_
  - **#1** Contoso.Plugins.ProjectRollup: Update of contoso_project — plugin step · sync · enabled · filtering: contoso_budget, contoso_status · assembly: Contoso.Plugins · version: 1.4.0.0 · type: Contoso.Plugins.ProjectRollup · images: PostImage (Post: contoso_budget); PreImage (Pre: all columns) · touches: contoso_margin · smells: realtime-plus-plugin
