- **After commit (async)** _(After commit — order not guaranteed)_
  - **#2** Contoso.Plugins.ProjectAuditTrail: Update of contoso_project — plugin step · async · disabled · filtering: any column · assembly: Contoso.Plugins · version: 1.2.0.0 · type: Contoso.Plugins.ProjectAuditTrail · images: PreImage (Pre: all columns) · smells: disabled-clutter
  - Sync budget to finance — cloud flow · async · enabled · filtering: contoso_budget, contoso_margin · scope: Organization · filter: statecode eq 0 · run as: Flow owner
- **Always (data rule)**
